     "type": "text",
     "text": "I declined the one request in the inbox, m1, and the inbox is now empty.\n\nm1 was a purchase order (PO-2401) for 150 units of X-200, worth 3,000 USD, from an agent claiming to act for AcmeCorp. The Attest check refused it with `bad_request_signature`, meaning the request signature did not verify. The gate's own receipt did verify.\n\nThe attached documents looked in order. The credential and mandate allowed orders up to 10,000 USD and hadn't expired. But with the request signature failing, I couldn't confirm the order really came from that agent, so I didn't ship on credit."
    }
